sequenceDiagram
    participant E as InitialExposureAssessmentDelayDeclined
    participant H as AdverseActionNoticeHandler
    participant D as AchUnderwritingDelayAanManager
    participant R as CustomerAchUnderwritingRepository
    participant Bus as Azure Service Bus
    participant P as PendingAchUnderwritingAssessmentAanHandler
    participant M as MediatR
    participant S as CreateAdverseActionNotice.Handler

    E->>H: Delay decline message
    H->>H: Build CreateAdverseActionNotice.Command
    H->>D: HandleAchUnderwritingDelayAan(command)
    D->>R: Create or update ACH record
    Note over D,R: AchUnderWritingStatus = AchPending\nAanStatus = Pending\nCorrelationId stored
    D->>Bus: Schedule PendingAchUnderwritingAssessmentAan

    Note over Bus,P: Later at EventCreatedDate + PublishDelayInMinutes

    Bus->>P: PendingAchUnderwritingAssessmentAan
    P->>R: GetRecord(customerId)

    alt Record no longer pending or correlation changed
        P-->>Bus: Skip AAN generation
    else Record still pending
        P->>M: Send stored CreateAdverseActionNotice.Command
        M->>S: Run normal shared handler
        S-->>P: Notice generated or deduped
        P->>R: Update AanStatus
    end
